            <note corresp="#d434-f1" n="1" xml:id="d434-f1-content">
                <p>A handwritten note in the margin of the source text, marked by an “x” to this
                    point in the text, read: “This is the second installment of the OPC stuff.” For
                    information concerning this list of military equipment, see footnote 4, Document
